}</style><div class="isolate">
  <div class="rich-text content-container color-scheme-5 gradient rich-text--full-width content-container--full-width section-template--25457907859773__rich_text_PtneDz-padding">
    <div class="rich-text__wrapper rich-text__wrapper--center page-width">
      <div class="rich-text__blocks center"><h2
                class="rich-text__heading rte inline-richtext h1 scroll-trigger animate--slide-in"
                
                
                  data-cascade
                  style="--animation-order: 1;"
                
              >
                About Us
              </h2><div
                class="rich-text__text rte scroll-trigger animate--slide-in"
                
                
                  data-cascade
                  style="--animation-order: 2;"
                
              >
                <p>The Space is a brand dedicated to creating cutting-edge kitchen products that redefine convenience and quality. Our previous successes include the groundbreaking Neovide sous vide cooker, which is the first waterless and bagless sous vide cooker in the world, biodegradable vacuum bags, and commercial clear ice machines that have set new standards. Now, we present IceDuo, bringing the clarity of commercial clear ice to your home. We will, as always, continue to make your cooking space a fun space.</p>
              </div><div
                class="rich-text__buttons scroll-trigger animate--slide-in"
                
                
                  data-cascade
                  style="--animation-order: 3;"
                
              ><a
                    
                      href="/pages/about-us"
                    
                    class="button button--primary"
                  >Learn More</a></div><div class="image_rich">
                  <img src="//advanced-cuisine.com/cdn/shop/files/The_Space_Company-2.png?v=1763977605" />
                </div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


